---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="CompareKaro.in privacy policy. We respect your privacy and do not collect personal data.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h2>Data We Collect</h2>
      <p>CompareKaro.in is designed with privacy in mind. All calculations (EMI, SIP, FD, etc.) are performed entirely in your browser. We do not collect, store, or transmit any financial data you enter into our tools.</p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our website. This collects anonymized data such as pages visited, time spent, and general geographic location. No personally identifiable information is collected through analytics.</p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>We display advertisements through Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use minimal cookies for site functionality and analytics. Third-party advertisers may also set cookies. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to external websites (e.g., product purchase links, operator websites). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related questions, please visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
